device p1016p8
descr P1016P8
partname p1016p8 P1016P8 (24-pin PAL, 10H/10K-style pinout)
pins 24
power 12 24
fuses 2056
array 32 64
lines p1 p23 p2 p22 p3 f21 f4 f17 f8 p16 p9 p15 p10 p14 p11 p13
mc 4 gen sum=8-15 polfuse=2049 polhi=0 reg=0
mc 5 gen sum=24-31 polfuse=2051 polhi=0 reg=0
